<title>UK: BHW Bausparkasse sets 250 mln mark two-year bond.</title>
<headline>BHW Bausparkasse sets 250 mln mark two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BHW BAUSPARKASSE AG</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON     3.50	MATURITY    25.JAN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.0     PAY DATE   L24.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	LISTING    HAN	 PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES	L-LONG FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.0	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
